Perhaps a misinterpretation of "cvs". cvs is the program that we used to keep 
track of who made what changes. If you look through the cvs logs, you can 
find out who invented such words as {nargile} and {odbenu}, who changed the 
article in front of {darvistci}, previous translations of "curiouser", etc.

